# Review routing for the files that define and enforce the trust surface.
#
# The trust-surface gate can be satisfied by editing the manifest: it checks
# that a justification is present, not that anyone read it. These entries put
# the reviewer the design assumes into the loop automatically.
#
# GitHub applies the LAST matching pattern, so general patterns come first.

*.gpr                            @manthonyaiello
/gnat.adc                        @manthonyaiello
/crates/*/gnat.adc               @manthonyaiello

/scripts/trust-surface.txt       @manthonyaiello
/scripts/check-trust-surface.sh  @manthonyaiello

/scripts/proof-xfail.txt         @manthonyaiello
/scripts/check-proof.sh          @manthonyaiello
